### DataDisplay Config (`dataDisplayConfig`)

`dataDisplayConfig` mirrors `DataDisplayProps` (Layer 2 + Layer 3) and adds chart-specific hover behaviour. When `mode="hover"`, the chart overwrites `mainLabelValue`, `dataHead.dataLeadValue`, and `badgeConfig.value` from the hovered series.

