| Prop                    | Type                                                   | Default    | Description                                                |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `mode`                  | `'static' \| 'hover'`                                  | `'static'` | `'hover'` updates lead value and badge on area hover       |
| `formatHoverLeadValue`  | `(seriesTotal: number, seriesName?: string) => string` | `undefined` | Formats `dataHead.dataLeadValue` in hover mode             |
| `formatHoverBadgeValue` | `(seriesTotal: number, seriesName?: string) => string` | `undefined` | Formats `badgeConfig.value` in hover mode                  |

