## Usage Examples

### Minimal

```tsx
<AreaChart data={data} />
```

### Full configuration

```tsx
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  width={520}
  height={400}
  seriesOrder={['Product A', 'Product B', 'Product C']}
  chartHeader
  chartLegend
  chartFooter
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: 'Monthly Performance',
    chartSubtitleValue: 'Stacked area — 2024',
  }}
  areaGroupConfig={{
    yAxis: true,
    xAxis: true,
    curveStyle: 'Curved',
    areaStackingType: 'stacked',
  }}
  chartFooterConfig={{
    annotationLeft: true,
    annotationLeftValue: 'Source: Finance Department.',
    annotationRight: true,
    annotationRightValue: 'Values in millions.',
  }}
/>
```

### Full width

```tsx
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  fullWidth
  height={360}
  chartHeaderConfig={{ chartTitleValue: 'Full Width Chart' }}
/>
```

### Chart only (no header / footer / legend)

```tsx
<AreaChart data={data} chartHeader={false} chartFooter={false} chartLegend={false} />
```

### Curve styles

```tsx
<AreaChart data={data} areaGroupConfig={{ curveStyle: 'Sharp' }} />
<AreaChart data={data} areaGroupConfig={{ curveStyle: 'Curved' }} />
```

### Stacking modes

```tsx
// Stacked (default) — series accumulate
<AreaChart data={data} areaGroupConfig={{ areaStackingType: 'stacked' }} />

// Layered — every series from zero baseline, overlap
<AreaChart data={data} areaGroupConfig={{ areaStackingType: 'layered' }} />

// Full height — normalised to 100% at every category
<AreaChart data={data} areaGroupConfig={{ areaStackingType: 'fullHeight' }} />
```

### With DataDisplay — static mode

```tsx
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay
  chartHeaderConfig={{ chartTitleValue: 'Revenue Breakdown' }}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: 'static',
    mainLabelValue: 'Total revenue',
    dataHead: {
      dataLeadValue: '£2,390',
      dataSupportingValue: '/ 3,000',
      supportingLabel: true,
      supportingLabelValue: 'Monthly target',
    },
    badgeConfig: {
      value: '+23.5%',
      appearance: 'positive',
    },
  }}
/>
```

### With DataDisplay — hover mode

DataDisplay updates on area hover. `mainLabelValue` shows the series name; `dataHead.dataLeadValue` shows the series total; `badgeConfig.value` shows the badge (formatted by your callbacks).

```tsx
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay
  interactive
  chartHeaderConfig={{ chartTitleValue: 'Market Share' }}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: 'hover',
    mainLabelValue: 'Hover a series to see details',
    dataHead: { dataLeadValue: '—' },
    badgeConfig: { value: '—' },
    formatHoverLeadValue: (total, name) => `${name}: £${total.toLocaleString()}`,
    formatHoverBadgeValue: (total) => `${((total / grandTotal) * 100).toFixed(1)}%`,
  }}
/>
```

### With entry animation and dataset morph

```tsx
const [data, setData] = useState(datasetA);

<AreaChart data={data} animated />

// Switching data triggers a smooth path morph
<button onClick={() => setData(datasetB)}>Switch</button>
```

### Value formatting

```tsx
// Percentage Y-axis
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  areaGroupConfig={{ valueFormat: { type: 'percentage' } }}
/>

// Currency Y-axis
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  areaGroupConfig={{ valueFormat: { type: 'currency', currency: 'INR', abbreviate: true } }}
/>

// Custom tick formatter
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  areaGroupConfig={{ yAxisConfig: { formatValue: (v) => `$${v}K` } }}
/>
```

### Broken Y-axis (outlier data)

```tsx
<AreaChart
  data={outlierData}
  areaGroupConfig={{
    yAxisConfig: { skippedTicks: [500, 2700], tickCount: 3 },
  }}
/>
```

### Custom legend items

```tsx
<AreaChart
  data={data}
  chartLegend
  chartLegendConfig={{
    items: [
      { type: 'circle', categoryLabelValue: 'Product A', color: 'var(--DataVis-Categorical-Bold-1)' },
      { type: 'circle', categoryLabelValue: 'Product B', color: 'var(--DataVis-Categorical-Bold-2)' },
    ],
